---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---
<section class="hero">
  <p class="eyebrow">RINHA4 TRANSPORT LANE</p>
  <h1>YOLO LOAD BALANCER: C BASELINE, ASM CHALLENGER.</h1>
  <p class="tagline">
    Standalone low-level load balancer for Jonathan Peris' Rinha de Backend 2026 .NET, C, and assembly stacks.
    The current C image supports proxy and fd-passing modes; the experiment tracks whether an assembly variant can replace it by default.
  </p>
  <div class="hero-actions">
    <a class="button primary" href={`${base}/docs/`}>Read the wiki</a>
    <a class="button" href={`${base}/reports/`}>View comparisons</a>
  </div>
</section>
